  "details": "If you do the thumbs up gesture on both hands it will show up as the idle hand position for everyone aside from you, regardless of if your gesture is custom animation or not. This is not a problem with any other gesture and doing a single thumbs up is fine on either hand, just not at the same time for both. It’s a strange and minor bug but it does matter for certain avatars.",
